==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Liepard|136}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Fasten Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Luxio|52}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

